==Finnish==

===Etymology===
* Originally active present participle (''[[-pä]]'') of the negative verb stem ''*e-''; see ''[[ei]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|e|pä}}
* {{IPA|/ˈepæ/|lang=fi}}

===Prefix===
'''epä-'''

# Used to invert the meaning of a word. English counterparts include [[in-]], [[non-]], [[un-]] (in some cases [[mis-]], [[mal-]]).
#: ''[[selvä]]'' (clear) – ''[[epäselvä]]'' (unclear)

